  "description": "The Tyax has everything a rider could need to start attaching the tough climbs and winding switchbacks that come with XC riding. Available in 29”, 27.5” and 24” wheel options and four component spec levels, it’s easy to find the right Tyax for you.\nThe hardtail choice of pro rider Greg Watts, the Tyax Expert 29er is a high performance MTB perfect for XC trail riding. Suggested rider height by size: SM: 5’2” – 5’6”, MD: 5’5” – 5’10”, LG: 5'9\" – 6'2.\nStiff, lightweight Tectonic T2 aluminum frame with tapered headtube, internal cable routing, replaceable hanger, and convertible QR dropouts.\n1 x 12 SRAM drivetrain with 3-piece SRAM SX Powerspline aluminum cranks and SRAM SX Eagle derailleur and shifters.\nSR Suntour XCR Air 100 mm travel fork with aluminum steerer and hydraulic lockout.\n29\" x 2.20\" Kenda Kadre tires on WTB ST-i29, aluminum double wall, tubeless compatible rims with Shimano BR-M400 hydraulic disc brakes.",
